Vendored DCS World scripting-API schema
========================================

These files are a frozen, unmodified copy of the `dcs-world-schema` project,
used by VEAF-Mission-Creation-Tools as the reference set of DCS scripting-API
functions (see the `audit-dcs-mocks` command) and, optionally, as an IDE
reference (EmmyLua/LuaLS) for contributors writing VEAF Lua.

Source:      https://github.com/YoloWingPixie/dcs-world-schema
Release tag: v0.3.5
Fetch date:  2026-06-27
License:     MIT (see the LICENSE file alongside)

Vendored artifacts
------------------
- dcs-world-api-schema.json  -- machine-readable API description (audit reference)
- dcs-world-api.lua          -- EmmyLua annotations for LuaLS autocomplete (.luarc.json)

Updating
--------
Updating these files is an explicit bump commit: re-download the assets from a
newer release tag, replace the files, and update the "Release tag" / "Fetch date"
fields above. Drift detection of this vendored copy is handled by the
VENDORED-DRIFT-WATCH lot.
